==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Zroco]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Celeboodle]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*2 [[Zroco]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Makoto Shishio (Enemy)|Makoto Shishio]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**5 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**2 [[Zang Roo]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
**1 [[Cadaver Bear]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.

